# Buboy - Unified Everyday Purchase Timeline (3-Slot Sandwich + Forgotten-Errand Riddles)
# Shifts ONLY on meaningful story flags (Flag_BuboyRunner / Flag_BuboyTrustedErrand).
# Voice: Energetic, innocent Bungisngis kid. Mainly English with light Filipino sprinkles.

label Greeting
# Slot 1: P1-P3 Reactive Opener or High-Price Remark
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Buboy: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
elif {Global_HighPriceActive}:
	Buboy: Hala Kuya, prices went up, po? Mama's gonna think I lost the change playing teks!

# Slot 2: Upfront Utang Ask OR Flag-Driven Forgotten-Errand Opener -> Riddle
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	Buboy: Kuya, funny story! My five-peso coin rolled right into the grass while I was racing a frog!
	Buboy: Can we put this on Mama's lista for now? She'll drop the coins off on her next walk, promise!
	- Sure, I'll put it on the list.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		Buboy: Yes! You're the coolest, Kuya! Okay, here's what Mama sent me for:
		jump Riddle
	- Go find your coin first, Buboy!
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		Buboy: Haha, fair enough, Kuya! Let me grab a stick and check the grass! Be right back!
		[end_timeline]
elif {Flag_BuboyRunner}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		Buboy: Hi, Kuya! I remembered almost everything Mama said, just forgot this one name!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		Buboy: Easy, [i]Damulag[/i], don't knock the candy jars! Kuya, help me guess this one before I forget the wrapper too!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		Buboy: Quick run, Kuya! I know which shelf it's on, just blanked on what it's called, hehe!
	else:
		Buboy: Tao po, Kuya! Kept all my coins safe this time, just forgot the item's name again!
elif {Flag_BuboyTrustedErrand}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		Buboy: Hi, Kuya! I didn't fold my list into an airplane, except my sweaty hand smudged it, hehe!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		Buboy: Hold still, [i]Damulag[/i]! Kuya, I remembered it all the way to the corner, then poof!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		Buboy: Help me out again, Kuya! The name's right on my tongue, let me describe it!
	else:
		Buboy: Hehe, tao po! Trying to get Mama's errand right on the first try, listen close, po!
else:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		Buboy: Stop wiggling, [i]Damulag[/i], quit chewing my sleeve! Kuya, I forgot what Mama asked for again, hehe!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		Buboy: Tao po! I whispered the name the whole way here, then I saw your store and forgot!
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		Buboy: Hi, Kuya! Mystery round! Forgot the name halfway down the road, though I remember the wrapper!
	else:
		Buboy: Hehe, Kuya! Promise not to laugh, ha, I forgot what Mama told me to buy again!
jump Riddle

label Riddle
# Crisp 2-line forgotten-errand descriptions by {Transaction_ItemWantsID} (never spoils the item name!)
if {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "argentita":
	Buboy: The heavy round tin with red meat and a bright sun right on the label, po!
	Buboy: Mama cranks it open with that spinning wheel until it goes rrrrrk, smells awesome with onions!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "cenchuree":
	Buboy: The super flat round tin, po, not the tall one, the really squished flat one!
	Buboy: Smells just like the fish stalls at the market when Mama spreads it on bread!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "scam":
	Buboy: The blocky rectangle can with the pink meat tucked inside, Kuya!
	Buboy: Mama slices it flat and fries it until all the corners get super crispy, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "lucky9":
	Buboy: The meat can with a big lucky number printed right on the front, po!
	Buboy: Bigger than eight and smaller than ten! Hehe, bet you got that one, Kuya!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "mema":
	Buboy: The fish can swimming in red tomato sauce that Mama pours over hot soup!
	Buboy: Asked Mama to repeat the name and she just yelled to grab the number-one tin, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "anoba":
	Buboy: Those thin crunchy crackers stacked up neat like a tiny house roof, po!
	Buboy: There's a big triangle in font even though the chips are wavy squares! Weird snack!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "patos":
	Buboy: The bright yellow chip bag that sounds like a duck on the farm, quack quack!
	Buboy: Turns all ten of your fingers super yellow with cheese dust so you have to lick them clean!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "dantes":
	Buboy: The noisy snack bag full of mixed nuts and crunchy bits that goes tatatatata when you shake it!
	Buboy: Mama says the name sounds just like that handsome actor on TV!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "marites":
	Buboy: The super loud crunchy snack that the whole street hears the second you bite one!
	Buboy: Mama always laughs because it's named after aunties who gossip by the gate, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "ngaragya":
	Buboy: Those round crunchy cracker nuts in a small bag, Kuya!
	Buboy: The second you tear it open, the whole room smells just like Mama's adobo!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "utang":
	Buboy: The green crunchy ring snack with a farmer's salakot hat and a tiny vinegar bowl on front!
	Buboy: Mama laughs at the name because it's the exact word written inside your loan lista, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "champyon":
	Buboy: That box of white smoke sticks Papa sends me for, though Mama says I'm never allowed to touch them!
	Buboy: Sounds just like winning a first-place gold medal in a game, po!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "marboro":
	Buboy: The bright red box of grown-up smoke sticks, Kuya, definitely not the blue one!
	Buboy: Papa made me swear twice to get the red pack that looks all royal on front!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "mayti":
	Buboy: The green-and-white smoke box with the big red letter stamped on the front, po!
	Buboy: Papa says it feels cold like toothpaste in your throat, grown-ups are so weird, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "coke":
	Buboy: The dark fizzy bottle that goes pshhhh when you pop the cap off, Kuya!
	Buboy: All the bubbles jump straight up my nose and make me sneeze every single sip, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "water":
	Buboy: Just the plain clear bottle with zero color and zero taste inside, po!
	Buboy: Best thing ever after carrying [i]Damulag[/i] up and down the road!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "gin":
	Buboy: The tall clear glass bottle that smells like rubbing alcohol for scraped knees, Kuya!
	Buboy: Papa sent me on a secret run for it, please don't tell Mama, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "chubs":
	Buboy: Those soft colorful chewy candies shaped like tiny little pillows, po!
	Buboy: Tried saving half in my pocket for later once and ate them all in two minutes flat, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "mentor":
	Buboy: The long roll of round flat candies you pop out one by one with your thumb!
	Buboy: Turns your whole tongue icy cold whenever you breathe in after eating one!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "pocha":
	Buboy: That tiny sweet wrapper candy stores hand out when you're one peso short on change, po!
	Buboy: Mama told me never to shout the name out loud because it sounds like a bad word, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "tocino":
	Buboy: That sweet pink meat from inside your cold freezer, Kuya!
	Buboy: Smells like caramelized candy in the frying pan and wakes up our whole house!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "hotdog":
	Buboy: The pack of long red sausages from the freezer that goes on sticks with marshmallows!
	Buboy: My favorite ulam ever, especially when the skin blisters a little in the pan, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "borgir":
	Buboy: Those flat round meat patties from your freezer that go right between bread buns!
	Buboy: Tastes just like a fast-food drive-thru even when Mama fries it at home!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "nagets":
	Buboy: Those bite-sized frozen chicken pieces that turn golden and crunchy in oil, Kuya!
	Buboy: Bet I could eat twelve of those in one sitting, no problem, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "aryel":
	Buboy: That super fresh-smelling laundry powder packet Mama whips into giant suds in the basin!
	Buboy: Stuck my nose right into the bubbles once and stung both my eyes, don't try that, Kuya!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "kneestoes":
	Buboy: The little bathroom shampoo sachet that sounds just like the action song from school, po!
	Buboy: Head, shoulders, then the two parts down below! Hehe, forgot the rest of the song!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "kopimo":
	Buboy: The small brown packet grown-ups stir into steaming hot mugs, Kuya!
	Buboy: Took one sneaky sip from Papa's cup once, super bitter, made my whole face scrunch up!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "chicken":
	Buboy: The flat noodle pack with a hard curly brick inside and a chicken on the wrapper, po!
	Buboy: Pour hot water on it and boom, instant magic soup!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "pantit":
	Buboy: The yellow dry-noodle pack with zero soup that you toss in soy sauce and oil!
	Buboy: Comes with a tiny sour calamansi packet inside that makes the whole kitchen smell like a party!
else:
	Buboy: Hala, it really flew clean out of my head, Kuya, I got distracted watching a kite!
	Buboy: Just guess whichever staple Mama always grabs from your shelves, po!
[end_timeline]

label Talk
Buboy: Kuya, [i]Damulag[/i] is swishing his tail in my face! Want me to describe it again?
- Grabbing it now, Buboy!
	[end_timeline]
- Describe it again, please.
	Buboy: Okay, po, listen super close, ha!
	jump Riddle
- Sorry, we're out of stock.
	Buboy: Aww, fresh out, po? Okay Kuya, I'll tell Mama I'll zoom back once Uncle Mario drops off boxes!
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	Buboy: Yes, one down! Wait Kuya, there's still another item on my errand!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	Buboy: Salamat, po! Hold on, Mama asked for one more thing!
else:
	Buboy: Hehe, you're so good at guessing, Kuya! Just the rest of my list left, po!
if {Transaction_RemainingCount} > 0:
	jump Riddle
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	Buboy: Salamat for listing it, Kuya! Sprinting this straight home to Mama!
else:
	if {Global_TipActive}:
		Buboy: Mama said you can keep the extra coins when your prices are nice, salamat po!
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 34:
		Buboy: Bullseye, Kuya! Another mystery solved by the best team on the road, hehe!
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 67:
		Buboy: Fastest guesser on the road, Kuya! Hold on tight, [i]Damulag[/i], we're zooming back!
	else:
		Buboy: Salamat po, Kuya! See you next time I forget my list, hehe!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Repayment
Buboy: Kuya! Mama sent me straight over with the {Transaction_RepaymentAmount} pesos from our lista!
Buboy: Even tied the coins in a handkerchief so I couldn't drop them chasing frogs, hehe! All paid up, po!
[signal arg="repay_debt"]
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
Buboy: Hala, I don't think that's what Mama asked for, Kuya! Wait, let me describe it again, ha!
jump Riddle
